{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117474","id":3404362263,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7K6nIX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117474","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117474/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117474/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117474/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7a73d3f16b9e68696deeba234abd3153752b3d82","number":117474,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move signal ownership from `ClassDB` to `GDType`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow-up of #113586 \r\n- Needs and includes #111262 \r\n- Works towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12323\r\n\r\nMoves signal ownership from `ClassDB` to `GDType`, to further consolidate type inspection into `GDType`.\r\nAfter enum info, signal ownership is the next easiest thing, which is why I'm starting with it to further establish the pattern.\r\n\r\n~Draft until #111262 is merged.~\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\nAfter #113586, this is (luckily!) a fairly uninteresting PR:\r\n- Moves `signal_map` from `ClassDB::ClassInfo` to `GDType` as `self_signal_map`.\r\n- Adds `signal_map` to `GDType` as a cache of all signals throughout the hierarchy (for performance purposes). This can optimize signal lookup immensely.\r\n- Rejects signal registration attempts after the type is finalized.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c